roactive layer of protection supports both real-time threat detection and ongoing monitoring.\nRead more."},"57":{"id":"/docs/ui-32","page_id":"/docs/ui","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui#how-do-you-meet-aml-obligations","content":"Ambriel offers a suite of Anti-Money Laundering (AML) compliance tools designed to simplify regulatory adherence while enhancing fraud detection capabilities. These tools integrate seamlessly with the Fraud API, providing a holistic approach to financial crime prevention."},"58":{"id":"/docs/ui-33","page_id":"/docs/ui","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui#how-do-you-meet-aml-obligations","content":"Ambriel's AML tools are designed to be compatible with the Anti-Money Laundering Directive (AMLD5/6) of the European Union, as well as the recommendations of the Financial Action Task Force (FATF).\nRead more."},"59":{"id":"/docs/ui-34","page_id":"/docs/ui","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui#how-do-you-vet-business-customers","content":"Ambriel's Know Your Business (KYB) solution enables organizations to assess and verify the legitimacy of business entities they engage with. By analyzing company registration data, ownership structures, and corporate relationships, the KYB API helps identify shell companies, beneficial owners, and potential money laundering risks. This comprehensive risk assessment supports due diligence requirements and ensures compliance with regulatory standards."},"60":{"id":"/docs/ui-35","page_id":"/docs/ui","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui#how-do-you-vet-business-customers","content":"Ambriel's KYB tools are designed to be compatible with the Anti-Money Laundering Directive (AMLD5/6) of the European Union, as well as the recommendations of the Financial Action Task Force (FATF).\nRead more."},"61":{"id":"/docs/ui-36","page_id":"/docs/ui","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui#how-do-you-screen-and-monitor-customers","content":"The AML API and Fraud API collaborate to screen customers against global sanction lists, PEP (Politically Exposed Persons) da