e score ranges for Low/Medium/High/Severe classifications.Tip: Set based on your approval workflows (e.g., scores under 15 = auto-approve, 15-30 = manual review, 30+ = escalate to compliance)."},"1262":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-116","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#configuration-options","content":"Score CapSet a maximum total score to prevent outliers.Use case: Cap at 100 to avoid a company with 20 triggered rules skewing your analytics."},"1263":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-117","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#configuration-options","content":"Category WeightsMultiply specific rule categories by custom weights.Example: Set \"Sanctions & PEP\" category weight to 2× if regulatory fines in your jurisdiction are severe."},"1264":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-118","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#best-use-cases","content":"General KYB programs: Most versatile approach, suitable for 80% of businesses Proportionate risk assessment: Want risk to scale with number of issues Customer segmentation: Differentiate between \"clean,\" \"some concerns,\" and \"high-risk\" tiers Regulated industries: Banks, payment processors, crypto exchanges with graduated compliance requirements"},"1265":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-119","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#best-use-cases","content":"Real scenario: A neobank uses this strategy to segment customers into risk tiers. Scores 0-20 get instant approval, 21-40 need document verification, 41+ require senior compliance sign-off."},"1266":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-120","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#how-it-works-1","content":"This strategy uses only the single highest rule score as the final result. All other triggered rules are ignored for scoring purposes."},"1267":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-121","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#how-it-works-1","content":"Philosophy: In compliance, one critical red flag (sanctions hit, fraud indicator, PEP exposure) should override everything else. A company can't be \"low risk\" just because it scored well on other criteria."},"1268":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-122","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#real-world-example-1","content":"You're screening a corporate services provider. Three rules trigger:"},"1269":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-123","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#real-world-example-1","content":"Rule Triggered"},"1270":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-124","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#real-world-example-1","content":"Impact"},"1271":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-125","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#real-world-example-1","content":"Likelihood"},"1272":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-126","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#real-world-example-1","content":"Weight"},"1273":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-127","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#real-world-example-1","content":"Score"},"1274":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-128","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#real-world-example-1","content":"Small company (under 10 employees)"},"1275":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-129","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#real-world-example-1","content":"2"},"1276":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-130","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","type":"text","url":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies#real-world-example-1","content":"3"},"1277":{"id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies-131","page_id":"/docs/ui/kyb/strategies","ty